/F2 10.8 Tf
1 0 0 1 54.0 355.0 Tm
(Fast closure algorithm:) Tj
0 0 0 rg
/F1 10.2 Tf
1 0 0 1 66.0 335.0 Tm
(1. Start with X+ = X.) Tj
/F1 10.2 Tf
1 0 0 1 66.0 322.0 Tm
(2. Repeatedly apply any FD A -> B where A is contained in X+; add B to X+.) Tj
/F1 10.2 Tf
1 0 0 1 66.0 309.0 Tm
(3. Stop when no more attributes can be added.) Tj
/F1 10.2 Tf
1 0 0 1 66.0 296.0 Tm
